"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX3 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 TX3 并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` 设置为「4」。"

